#: lib/ui/screens/rules/widgets/last_page.dart:
msgid "Almost done!"
msgstr "¡Casi listo!"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/widgets/last_page.dart:
msgid "Before starting tell me your name which will be used in the game."
msgstr "Antes de comenzar dime el nombre que quieres usar en el juego."

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Solve ice puzzles and defeat enemies in an RPG world.\n\nSwipe right to learn the basic concepts."
msgstr "Resuelve rompecabezas gélidos y derrota enemigos en un mundo RPG.\n\nDesliza a la derecha para aprender los conceptos básicos."

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Modes"
msgstr "Modalidades"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "There are two modes in Xeonjia:\n\n1) Story: the world has been frozen and your duty is to defeat the \"King of Evil\" and save the kingdom.\n\n2) Multiplayer: defeat enemies, score points and make your team win."
msgstr "Existen dos modalidades:\n\n1) Historia: el mundo ha sido congelado y tu misión es derrotar al Rey del Mal y salvar el reino.\n\n2) Multijugador: derrota enemigos, anota puntos y haz ganar a tu equipo."

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Movements"
msgstr "Movimientos"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Swipe your finger to move your character across the world.\nKeep in mind that you can't stop yourself until you reach a wall, a boulder, or any other type of obstacle.\n\nUse your mind to figure out the best path!"
msgstr "Desliza tu dedo para mover tu personaje a través del mundo.\nToma en cuenta que no puedes detenerte hasta dar con un muro, una roca o cualquier otro tipo de obstáculo.\n\n¡Usa tu intelecto para encontrar el mejor camino!"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Lifepoints"
msgstr "HP"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Pay attention to your lifepoints!\nMany enemies, pitfalls and dangers will try to hurt you."
msgstr "¡Pon atención a tu HP!\nMuchos enemigos, trampas y peligros trataran de lastimarte."

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Weapons"
msgstr "Armas"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "You'll need weapons to overcome barriers and defeat enemies.\n\nTap the screen in the desired direction or press the shoot button to hit.\nBe aware that some weapons have few hits, so use them wisely."
msgstr "Necesitarás armas para superar los obstáculos y derrotar tus enemigos.\n\nToca la pantalla en la dirección deseada o presiona el botón de disparar asestar un golpe.\nTen en cuenta que algunas armas tienen pocas municiones, úsalas con sabiduría."

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Enemies"
msgstr "Enemigos"

#: lib/ui/screens/rules/resources/rules.dart:
msgid "Be careful, the world is full of dangerous enemies ready to attack you!\nHit them several times to defeat them; they have life points too."
msgstr "Ten cuidado, ¡el mundo está lleno de peligrosos enemigos listos para atacarte!\nAsesta varios golpes para derrotarlos; también tienen HP."

